Z||000006||Alex4mula||09-10-2001||04:15 PM||||Congratulations! I once entered in a show like that. Was the only Fiero and felt kinda lonely but.. many many people went over to see my car and were impressed with it. They had three trophies for the Fiero category. Too sad no one else showed up.||||reg||1
